romote their products and services. Below is a&nbsp;digital marketing platform&nbsp;list, exploring media channels where you can run paid and unpaid campaigns and capture the attention of potential buyers.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1.&nbsp;Google Ads<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"293\" height=\"172\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-ads.webp\" alt=\"Google Ads\" class=\"wp-image-7936\" style=\"width:297px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-ads.webp 293w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-ads-150x88.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 293px) 100vw, 293px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p>When we talk about paid advertising or <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-ppc\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">pay-per-click<\/a>, Google Ads is one of the most essential&nbsp;digital platforms for marketing. It allows marketers to display their ads at the top of search engine results and grab user attention instantly. It targets audiences based on search history, location, device, and more.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Use Google Ads to bid on relevant <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-keywords\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">keywords<\/a> and decide where you want your ad to appear. With an effective bid strategy and&nbsp;high Quality&nbsp;Score, you can ensure your ad reaches the right people to drive conversions. You pay only when users click on your ad, making it a cost-effective platform.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You pay only when a user clicks the ad&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to track and manage activities&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>40% more chances of clicks&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Wider reach&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to create campaigns&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cons:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Users often ignore paid ads&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Excessive competition&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2.&nbsp;Facebook (Meta Ads)<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/meta-ads-logo.webp\" alt=\"Meta Ads\" class=\"wp-image-19799\" style=\"width:354px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/meta-ads-logo.webp 2000w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/meta-ads-logo-300x169.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/meta-ads-logo-1024x576.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/meta-ads-logo-768x432.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/meta-ads-logo-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Facebook<\/a> is one of the&nbsp;most commonly used&nbsp;online marketing platforms&nbsp;with around 2.9 billion active monthly users. Companies using Facebook can&nbsp;witness&nbsp;a significant increase in revenue and brand popularity.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Facebook lets you select the audience based on behavior patterns, interests, demographics, and locations. It adds value to brand image, name, and popularity. Advertisers can run customized ads based on the target audience, resulting in higher sales and returns than many other marketing platforms in India.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Different types&nbsp;of ads&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Highly targeted marketing&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Manageable budgets&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cost-effective marketing&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cons:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Lower conversion rates&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Users often skip ads&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Frequent ads can appear spammy and hamper user experience&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3.&nbsp;Instagram<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"148\" height=\"148\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/instagram-logo.webp\" alt=\"Instagram\" class=\"wp-image-19231\" style=\"width:204px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Instagram<\/a> has become one of the&nbsp;best digital marketing platforms&nbsp;for visual brands, lifestyle businesses, and D2C companies in India. With&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.statista.com\/statistics\/578364\/countries-with-most-instagram-users\/?srsltid=AfmBOoq8pAhcLWk4TCTBnybx-_Y6Nt2M5zljia6r-yZ3ygNkdAiSxgi6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">480.55 million users in India<\/a>, it is the go-to platform for reaching younger, mobile-first audiences.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Instagram Reels, Stories, and Shopping features make it a complete&nbsp;platform for <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">digital marketing<\/a>&nbsp;from brand discovery to&nbsp;purchase. Influencer marketing on Instagram is particularly powerful in the Indian market, where creator-led content drives massive engagement.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Strong visual storytelling capabilities&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Reels drive 2 to 4x more engagement than static content&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Seamless integration with Facebook Ads Manager&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ideal for fashion, food, beauty, and lifestyle brands&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cons:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Requires consistent, high-quality visual content&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Organic reach has declined; paid promotion often necessary&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Not ideal for B2B or technical industries&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-abae2c5a9a82b09d22d1c01fb446b486\"><em><strong>Pro Tip:<\/strong>&nbsp;You&nbsp;don&#8217;t&nbsp;need a big production budget for Instagram Reels. A smartphone, good lighting, and a clear message work better than over-produced content. Authenticity wins with Indian audiences in 2026.&nbsp;<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4.&nbsp;Twitter (X)<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/twitter.webp\" alt=\"Twitter\" class=\"wp-image-7938\" style=\"width:208px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/twitter.webp 1600w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/twitter-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/twitter-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/twitter-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/twitter-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/twitter-1536x1536.webp 1536w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/twitter-96x96.webp 96w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/x.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Twitter<\/a> is a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-platforms\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">social media platform<\/a> that marketers and businesses use to promote their products and boost sales. It is among the top 10 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/most-visited-websites\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">most visited websites<\/a> globally, with a recorded 2.4 billion sessions in 2021. Twitter is known as one of the most liberal platforms and\u00a0represents\u00a0high-income audiences.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Twitter (now rebranded as X) ads are comparatively more budget-friendly among&nbsp;different types&nbsp;of&nbsp;digital marketing platforms. It helps businesses drive higher organic traffic to websites and achieve marketing goals more effectively.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Economical marketing method&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Engaging platform&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Information reaches users faster&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cons:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Demands unique ways to update information&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Requires effort, time, and&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;to manage ads&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Risk of spreading negative impressions&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5.&nbsp;LinkedIn<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1400\" height=\"362\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/linkedin.webp\" alt=\"Linkedin\" class=\"wp-image-7939\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3.8676258992805757;width:396px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/linkedin.webp 1400w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/linkedin-300x78.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/linkedin-1024x265.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/linkedin-768x199.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/linkedin-150x39.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1400px) 100vw, 1400px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p>With around&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.theglobalstatistics.com\/india-linkedin-user-statistics\/#main\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">150 million users in India<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">LinkedIn<\/a> is certainly among the most valuable&nbsp;digital advertising platforms&nbsp;for connecting with professionals, industry leaders, clients, and business partners.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It is among the&nbsp;top digital marketing platforms&nbsp;that let users create business communities. LinkedIn ads are economical and accessible to new businesses and small companies. Although customizing LinkedIn ads can be tricky, it allows highly targeted marketing campaigns. It is especially powerful for B2B marketing in India.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Great place&nbsp;to reach high-value B2B buyers&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Responsive, professional audience&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Precise and efficient targeting&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can target a specific market, business, or industry&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cons:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Interface can be tricky&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cost-per-click is higher than other platforms&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Data roadblocks can reduce reach<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\"Cracking Meta &amp; Google Ads 2026 - Data, Automation &amp; Attribution\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/ai-engineering-roadmap-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T123426_340_1785490284771_211381.webp\" alt=\"AI Engineering Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/how-to-build-an-ai-agent-from-scratch?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-03T133829_740__1__1786010890597_768466.webp\" alt=\"How to Build an AI Agent from Scratch \" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/soc-analyst-career-demand-in-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-04T111115_404_1786011909630_974751.webp\" alt=\"SOC Analyst Career Demand in 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/booming-digital-marketing-career-in-ai-era?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-07T104930_382_1786105407836_186872.webp\" alt=\"Booming Digital Marketing Career in AI Era\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cybersecurity-professional-career-roadmap-2026-2?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-05T122121_005_1786351858212_930412.webp\" alt=\"Cybersecurity Professional Career Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6.&nbsp;YouTube<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"310\" height=\"163\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/youtube.webp\" alt=\"YouTube\" class=\"wp-image-7940\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/youtube.webp 310w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/youtube-300x158.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/youtube-150x79.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 310px) 100vw, 310px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p>Businesses have realized the importance of unique and innovative video&nbsp;content in&nbsp;influencing buying decisions. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">YouTube<\/a> gets over 14 billion visits every month and is considered the most effective ad format among various&nbsp;digital marketing platforms. Since Google owns YouTube, you can promote your videos through Google Search as well.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>With&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.statista.com\/statistics\/280685\/number-of-monthly-unique-youtube-users\/?srsltid=AfmBOoq56qVy0WdpsYSF41R0TrWnRl1A7QtHZlCFrbW1Sa4igvqxE-cL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">518 million active users in India<\/a>, YouTube is the single largest video content discovery platform in the country. Short-form content via YouTube Shorts is also rapidly growing among Indian audiences in 2026.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Engaging marketing&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Huge scope for influencer marketing&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to track effectiveness of ads and video parameters&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to target audience using&nbsp;various options&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cons:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Users often skip ads&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Not always easy to reach the target audience&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7.&nbsp;WhatsApp Business<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"224\" height=\"224\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/whatsapp-business.webp\" alt=\"WhatsApp Business\" class=\"wp-image-19821\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/whatsapp-business.webp 224w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/whatsapp-business-150x150.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 224px) 100vw, 224px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/whatsappbusiness.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">WhatsApp Business<\/a> has evolved from a communication tool into one of the most powerful&nbsp;online marketing platforms in India. With millions of users in India, WhatsApp is where Indian consumers are most active and responsive.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In 2026, WhatsApp&#8217;s integration with payments, product catalogs, and Click-to-WhatsApp ads has made it a complete commerce channel for Indian businesses. D2C brands with properly built WhatsApp automation report that the platform contributes 20 to35% of their total digital revenue.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Direct, personal communication with customers&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>High open rates compared to email&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Free to use for businesses (WhatsApp Business App)&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Supports product catalogs, automated replies, and payments&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cons:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Requires an opted-in contact list to avoid spam&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Broadcast lists have limitations&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Scaling requires WhatsApp Business API (paid)&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8.&nbsp;Amazon Ads<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"646\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/amazon-ads-scaled.webp\" alt=\"Amazon Ads\" class=\"wp-image-19822\" style=\"width:434px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/amazon-ads-scaled.webp 2560w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/amazon-ads-300x76.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/amazon-ads-1024x258.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/amazon-ads-768x194.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/amazon-ads-1536x387.webp 1536w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/amazon-ads-2048x517.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.in\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Amazon<\/a> needs no introduction. It is the biggest online shopping website in the world, with over&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.investing.com\/academy\/statistics\/amazon-facts\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">2.2 billion monthly visitors<\/a>. Its exceptional reach and popularity have made it one of the&nbsp;top digital marketing platforms&nbsp;for e-commerce businesses globally and in India.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Companies use Amazon Ads to earn revenue and&nbsp;establish&nbsp;their brand names. Any registered vendor can run ads on Amazon and&nbsp;witness&nbsp;a rapid increase in sales.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Real-time optimization&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Several advertising options&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Real-time performance tracking&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to edit ads&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Reach the right people at the right time&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cons:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Reporting is less effective compared to other platforms&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Demands more time than other platforms&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">9.&nbsp;Google Business Profile<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1866\" height=\"1050\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-business-profile.webp\" alt=\"Google Business Profile\" class=\"wp-image-19823\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.777190082644628;width:478px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-business-profile.webp 1866w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-business-profile-300x169.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-business-profile-1024x576.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-business-profile-768x432.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/google-business-profile-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1866px) 100vw, 1866px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/business.google.com\/en-all\/business-profile\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Google Business Profile<\/a> (formerly Google My Business) is one of the most powerful free&nbsp;digital marketing platforms&nbsp;available to Indian businesses today. It is especially critical for local and regional businesses looking to improve visibility in Google Search and Google Maps.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>When someone searches for &#8220;digital marketing agency near me&#8221; or &#8220;restaurant in Jaipur,&#8221; businesses with an optimized Google Business Profile appear in the local results often before paid ads. It costs nothing to set up and&nbsp;maintain.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Free to use&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Boosts local search visibility significantly&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Drives calls, directions, and website visits&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customer reviews build trust and credibility&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cons:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Limited to local\/regional marketing&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Requires consistent management of reviews and updates&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Not effective for purely online or national businesses&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">10.&nbsp;Pinterest<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"454\" height=\"111\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/pinterest.webp\" alt=\"Pinterest\" class=\"wp-image-7942\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/pinterest.webp 454w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/pinterest-300x73.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/pinterest-150x37.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 454px) 100vw, 454px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Pinterest<\/a> is among the newer digital marketing platforms&nbsp;that started as a small channel but has grown over time. It is famously used to pin innovative ideas, but companies also use it to&nbsp;showcase&nbsp;their products and brands. It even recorded higher sales than many other well-known e-commerce sites for specific categories like home d\u00e9cor, fashion, and food.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Best platform for showcasing product images&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Enhanced user experience&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to highlight&nbsp;different aspects&nbsp;of business using boards&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cons:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Limited audience compared to Facebook and Instagram&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Needs high-quality pictures to rank well&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Closed system (users require an account to access it)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-1d53f14b476de41e9f61f4ae94d56b11\"><strong>Read More Guides Related to Digital Marketing<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-funnel\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Funnel<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-future\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Future of Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/benefits-of-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Benefits of Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-trends\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Latest Digital Marketing Trends<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-channels\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Channels<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-roi\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing ROI<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a hr